00:16:06,030 --> 00:16:07,800
我们会报警并起诉你
we will call the police and press charges.

360
00:16:07,800 --> 00:16:08,770
我们明白
We understand.

361
00:16:08,770 --> 00:16:10,050
非常感谢
Thank you so much.

362
00:16:10,360 --> 00:16:11,260
那我呢
Uh, what about me?

363
00:16:11,260 --> 00:16:13,240
你哪里也不能去  接吻狂魔
No, you're not going anywhere, kissy face.

364
00:16:13,840 --> 00:16:14,680
来吧
Let's go.

365
00:16:14,680 --> 00:16:17,230
我要给你们拍照贴在大门外
I have to take your picture to post at the guard gate.

366
00:16:17,700 --> 00:16:19,530
关于照片我有个问题
Uh, one question about that picture.

367
00:16:19,530 --> 00:16:21,970
我能跟乔治·卢卡斯一起拍吗
Can it be with George Lucas?

368
00:16:23,720 --> 00:16:25,880
好凶巴巴哦
Ooh, grumpy you are.

369
00:16:30,940 --> 00:16:33,470
好了  现在是最终对决
Okay, this is the match that decides it all.

370
00:16:33,470 --> 00:16:34,680
先得十一分的人赢
First to 11 wins.

371
00:16:34,680 --> 00:16:37,780
每五分换发一次
Serve switches every five points.

372
00:16:37,780 --> 00:16:39,530
跟你说一声  本来一开始
And just so you know, when this started,

373
00:16:39,530 --> 00:16:42,090
我只是想把塔迪斯放在房子不碍事的角落
I was going to put the TARDIS in a discreet corner of the house,

374
00:16:42,090 --> 00:16:43,330
可是我现在生气了
but I've since turned mean,

375
00:16:43,330 --> 00:16:45,150
所以我会把它摆在客厅的最中间
and now it's going right in the middle of the living room

376
00:16:45,150 --> 00:16:47,250
或者放在转台上  并挂着"咬我啊"
on a rotating platform with a sign that says "Suck it".

377
00:16:47,250 --> 00:16:48,670
比赛开始
Game on.

378
00:16:50,840 --> 00:16:52,000
反正
Except...

379
00:16:52,000 --> 00:16:53,830
拉杰会赢
Raj is gonna win.

380
00:16:53,830 --> 00:16:55,290
是不是  拉杰
Isn't that right, Raj?

381
00:16:55,610 --> 00:16:57,700
可是她发球发得不错
Uh, yeah, I mean, her serve was pretty good.

382
00:16:57,700 --> 00:16:59,260
给点力啊  攻敌先攻心
Come on, get in her head.

383
00:16:59,260 --> 00:16:59,980
气势上先压倒她
Be intimidating.

384
00:16:59,980 --> 00:17:02,020
好吧
Okay, uh...

385
00:17:02,360 --> 00:17:03,940
我会虐爆你的  贱人
I'm gonna own you, bitch!

386
00:17:05,450 --> 00:17:06,960
太过分了
That's not nice.

387
00:17:08,030 --> 00:17:09,650
我们还是开始吧
Let's just play.

388
00:17:13,450 --> 00:17:14,910
一比零
One-zero.

389
00:17:15,330 --> 00:17:16,430
二
Two.

390
00:17:16,860 --> 00:17:18,050
三
Three.

391
00:17:18,580 --> 00:17:19,810
四
Four.

392
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:22,240
五比零
Five-nothing.

393
00:17:22,240 --> 00:17:24,320
等等  你以前打的是羽毛球
Wait, did you play badminton

394
00:17:24,320 --> 00:17:26,520
还是羽毛糗
or sad-minton?

395
00:17:27,580 --> 00:17:29,790
别听他的  她就只有发球好
Don't listen to him-- all she's got is a serve.

396
00:17:29,790 --> 00:17:32,920
去换个新卫生棉条再来干掉她
Now, grab a fresh tampon and put her away.

397
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:33,670
啥
Wha...?

398
00:17:33,670 --> 00:17:35,280
这话就不过分吗
A-And that's not offensive?

399
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:36,310
标准到底在哪
Where's the line?

400
00:17:36,310 --> 00:17:38,400
在你的女用皮包里  赶紧打
It's in your purse. Play.

401
00:17:41,480 --> 00:17:42,480
一比五
One-five.

402
00:17:43,400 --> 00:17:44,460
二比五
Two-five.

403
00:17:45,210 --> 00:17:46,480
三比五
Three-five.

404
00:17:46,920 --> 00:17:48,240
四比五
Four-five.

405
00:17:49,070 --> 00:17:50,680
五比五
Five-five!

406
00:17:52,050 --> 00:17:53,030
六
Six.

407
00:17:53,470 --> 00:17:54,610
七
Seven.

408
00:17:54,610 --> 00:17:55,960
八
Eight.

409
00:17:56,410 --> 00:17:57,710
九
Nine.

410
00:17:58,500 --> 00:18:00,360
十比五
Ten-five!

411
00:18:02,300 --> 00:18:03,670
六
Six.

412
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:05,860
七
Seven.

413
00:18:07,210 --> 00:18:08,110
八
Eight.

414
00:18:08,760 --> 00:18:09,720
九
Nine.

415
00:18:10,750 --> 00:18:12,230
十比十
Ten-ten!

416
00:18:16,330 --> 00:18:18,850
刚才那四十秒真是激动人心啊
Well, that was an exciting 40 seconds.

417
00:18:20,260 --> 00:18:22,790
的确是  不过现在回到你发球了
It was, and now the serve is back to you,

418
00:18:22,790 --> 00:18:24,710
游戏要结束了
and the game is over.

419
00:18:25,370 --> 00:18:27,730
你知道吗  艾米  我
You know, Amy, I, uh...

420
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:30,370
我一直在想要是塔迪斯在你家
can't help but wonder how Sheldon would react

421
00:18:30,370 --> 00:18:33,390
谢尔顿会有什么反应
if the TARDIS was at your place.

422
00:18:33,390 --> 00:18:35,900
别听她的  快发球
Don't listen to her, just hit the ball.

423
00:18:35,900 --> 00:18:37,530
继续说
Keep talking.

424
00:18:42,270 --> 00:18:44,510
如果连这个都不能拐他进你闺房
If this doesn't get him into your bedroom,

425
00:18:45,010 --> 00:18:46,610
也没有别的可以了
nothing will.

426
00:18:52,690 --> 00:18:53,830
你还在生我气吗
Are you still mad at me?

427
00:18:53,830 --> 00:18:58,130
对  我们没赶上演讲  差点被拘捕
Yes, we missed our lecture, we were almost arrested,

428
00:18:58,130 --> 00:18:59,790
你还害我跟一个强行把舌头
and you got me locked in a room with a man

429
00:18:59,790 --> 00:19:03,070
塞进伍基人玩偶喉咙里的男人关在一起
who forced his tongue down the throat of a stuffed Wookie.

430
00:19:05,020 --> 00:19:07,940
杯子半空的悲观人儿啊
Boy, some people are just glass-half-empty.

431
00:19:08,390 --> 00:19:09,940
杯子是全空的好吗  谢尔顿
The glass is empty, Sheldon.

432
00:19:09,940 --> 00:19:11,080
完全是空的
It's completely empty.

433
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:13,150
如果你把那杯子给一个快要渴死的人
If you gave that glass to a man who was dying of thirst,

434
00:19:13,150 --> 00:19:15,110
他就死定了  你知道为什么吗
he would be dead, do you know why?

435
00:19:15,110 --> 00:19:18,720
我先问一下  他抽烟吗
Before I answer, was he a smoker?

436
00:19:22,980 --> 00:19:25,230
我觉得你看待事情的角度不对
I think you're looking at this all wrong.

437
00:19:25,230 --> 00:19:27,760
好吧  那你告诉我我应该怎么看待这件事
Fine, then tell me how I should be looking at it.

438
00:19:27,760 --> 00:19:32,270
我们不仅到了天行者农场  还进到里面了
Well, not only did we go to Skywalker Ranch, we got in.

439
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:34,560
我们认识的人里没人做到过
And no one we know can say that.

440
00:19:34,560 --> 00:19:37,740
而且你不是一直觉得我很烦人吗
And for all the times you find me irritating,

441
00:19:37,740 --> 00:19:41,490
今天你终于可以有人电击我了
today you got to watch someone shoot me with a Taser.

442
00:19:44,600 --> 00:19:46,640
这部分是不错
That part was pretty good.

443
00:19:47,160 --> 00:19:48,480
是吧
See?

444
00:19:49,030 --> 00:19:51,610
你被电到满地抽抽啊
You did flop around a lot.

445
00:19:52,720 --> 00:19:53,830
这一点我承认
I'll take your word for it.

446
00:19:53,830 --> 00:19:56,590
我当时正忙着不让自己尿出来
I was too busy trying not to defecate.

447
00:19:58,820 --> 00:20:02,410
话说他们带我们去拘留室的时候
You know, when they were escorting us to the detaining room,

448
00:20:02,410 --> 00:20:04,060
我看进一扇门
I looked through a door,

449
00:20:04,060 --> 00:20:06,280
我很确定我看到了一个展示台
and I'm pretty sure I saw a display case

450
00:20:06,280 --> 00:20:08,360
里面装着约柜[圣物]
with the Ark of the Covenant.

451
00:20:08,360 --> 00:20:10,530
-太神奇了  -就是啊
- That's amazing. - I know.

452
00:20:10,530 --> 00:20:14,590
我还看到赫特人贾巴骑着摩托车经过呢
And I saw Jabba the Hutt riding by on a motorcycle.

453
00:20:14,590 --> 00:20:16,490
不过那时我刚被电过
Although that was right after the Tasing,

454
00:20:16,490 --> 00:20:18,470
所以我也不确定是真是假
so who can say for sure?

455
00:20:19,710 --> 00:20:22,380
我觉得我们这可以算是一场冒险
I-I guess this could count as an adventure.

456
00:20:22,380 --> 00:20:23,840
确实是
It was.

457
00:20:23,840 --> 00:20:26,590
而且虽然他们禁止我们再去
And even though we're not allowed back there,

458
00:20:26,590 --> 00:20:29,350
但却夺不走我们今天的经历
they can never take today away from us.

459
00:20:29,350 --> 00:20:31,540
但不包括我的嗅觉
Unlike my sense of smell,

460
00:20:31,540 --> 00:20:34,190
被电击完到现在还没恢复呢
which hasn't returned since the Tasing.

461
00:20:36,830 --> 00:20:38,230
不  什么都闻不到
No, I got nothing.

462
00:20:44,860 --> 00:20:47,850
艾米  戴立克正追着我跑呢
Amy, the Daleks are right on my tail!

463
00:20:47,850 --> 00:20:49,990
快  我们得回去重设时间线
Quick, we need to reset the time circuits.

464
00:20:50,320 --> 00:20:53,740
不  我忘拿我的音速起子了
Oh, no, I left my sonic screwdriver behind.

465
00:20:58,030 --> 00:20:59,880
我当时真应该好好考虑
Really should have thought this through.

